    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And on hwam mæg huru æfre ænig man on worolde swyðor God wurðian þonne on cyrcan and on hælnessan and eft on gehalgedan healican hadan?</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And indeed, where in the world can anyone ever worship God better than in churches and in sanctuaries, and in the high holy orders also?</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 on hwam mæg huru æfre ænig man on worolde swyðor God wurðian þonne on cyrcan 7 on hælnessan 7 eft on gehalgedan healican hadan?</ab>
      </div>
